// Sheet S2, pulled by xln from m3a_names.xlsx: its formula cells in sheet order, then
// the names local to it that no module owns. Every name here is local to S2 unless
// the line above it says @workbook. A cell's address (@C6) is set in Excel and read-only;
// edit the formula after '='. `Name @C6 = ;` is a slot: a name on an empty cell.
// `Name @C6#` names the cell's spill, `Name @C6` the cell alone: add or remove the `#`.

@A1 = Loc;
@B1 = 'S1'!A1+'S2'!Loc;
@A2 = Rate+Loc;
@A3:A5 = Loc*ROW();

// Other names local to S2.

Loc = 7;
TmpC = 33;
